-- **Project files**: `knowledge.md`, `AGENTS.md`, or `CLAUDE.md` in each directory (priority order)
-- **User files**: `~/.knowledge.md`, `~/.AGENTS.md`, or `~/.CLAUDE.md` (case-insensitive)
